5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I think it's important that we look at the practical side of these proposals. We should ensure that whatever we choose is sustainable and has clear agreements in place to avoid future failures.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Midori. Beyond sustainability, I believe we should examine the actual outcomes of our previous efforts. It would be prudent to see what truly benefited the patients before we commit to a new direction.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We also need to consider the current workload of our staff. A program is only sustainable if the people implementing it aren't already burnt out. We should check the staffing levels carefully.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Practicality is fine, but let's not be naive. We often forget that ""established"" doesn't mean ""funded"" for the long term. I want to see the actual numbers regarding the budget and potential returns.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see everyone so focused. I agree with you all, but I also wonder if our dear hospital has the physical space and systems to hold something new without becoming too crowded.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, @Misaki, you both make great points. If we divide the available data sources, we can cover the budget, staffing, and operational risks together. Does anyone have a preference for which records they'd like to check first?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I would like to look into the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round. I believe these will show us what actually worked for our patients.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll take the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review. I want to see exactly where the pressure points are before we add more to the roster.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'll handle the financial side. I'll look into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location. Let's see if the money actually exists for the long haul.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I shall look into the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, as well as what the booking system records. I want to make sure our guests and staff can still move about comfortably.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,That leaves me to look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries. I want to see where previous collaborations may have faltered.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"That seems like a very balanced distribution. By covering the financial, operational, and clinical data, we can make a decision based on a complete picture rather than just a hopeful proposal.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"It seems efficient. Once we have the data, we can see which programs align with our actual capacity rather than just our aspirations. I look forward to seeing what you all find.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is the only thing that matters here. I'll be interested to see if the others' ""aspirations"" survive a cold look at the ledger. Let's proceed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree. Let us all be gentle with one another as we uncover these truths. I look forward to hearing what you find, and I hope we can find a path that keeps everyone happy.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we've reached an agreement. I'll focus on those collaboration records to ensure we build something that lasts. I look forward to our discussion in the next round once we've all reviewed the data.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I concur. I will examine the trial data and nursing rounds with a quiet mind. I look forward to seeing how our findings align to guide us toward a truly beneficial choice for our patients.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will focus on the staffing records. It is important that we don't overlook the human cost of these programs. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'll be reviewing the ledger and tariffs. Let's hope the numbers are more honest than the proposals. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I shall go and see how our rooms and booking systems are faring. I wish you all a peaceful afternoon of research. I will see you soon, dear friends.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
